Hi Qiang,

You are correct.  I also noticed a bug in the "getPositionOverlap()" function when dealing with exome data.  I am in the process of testing the fix and will update with a patch soon.  In the meantime, you should use v1.4.0 prior to the speed-up change for this function.

Sorry for the inconvenience this has caused.  And thank you for bringing this to my attention.  I appreciate the feedback.

Best,
Gavin

